  "title": "GRAVITY DOESN’T STAND A CHANCE RIMMEL LONDON & RED BULL DELIVER GRAVITY DEFYING LASHES & THRILLING BEAM ROUTINE STUNT",
  "summary": "London, 15th January 2026: Today, the generation defying beauty brand, Rimmel London has joined forced with Red Bull, to create a once-in-a-lifetime performance, that takes Red Bull athlete and five time national All-American gymnast, Lily Smith out of the gym and up to new heights. In her boldest challenge to date, Lily performed a daring 90-second balance beam routine 52 stories above street level!",
